  "empreinte": "c44f50f3fb217788fe19523e77e0818247405e581531c5ad4956037b7e2f6192",
  "page": 40,
  "citation": "In future iterations of the system, a researcher could choose outcomes and causes they are interested in, score hypotheses by interestingness",
