  "empreinte": "c44f50f3fb217788fe19523e77e0818247405e581531c5ad4956037b7e2f6192",
  "page": 49,
  "citation": "it queries an LLM with the survey question, the agent’s response, and information about the variable’s type to determine its correct numerical value as a string.",
