  "pdf": "docs/sources/pdf/lecture-o4-v3/arxiv-2404.11794/2404.11794v2.pdf",
  "empreinte": "c44f50f3fb217788fe19523e77e0818247405e581531c5ad4956037b7e2f6192",
  "page": 50,
  "citation": "It can also provide likelihood ratio, Wald, and Lagrange Multiplier tests to evaluate the model fit and compare path estimates.",
